    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. In your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), nominate one of your TYRANIDS MONSTER units before it is selected to move. The benefit lasts for the rest of that phase and applies to a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move), an [Advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) and a [Fall Back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back). The unit can cross terrain up to 4″ tall and pass through non-TITANIC models. Its path may enter enemy [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range), provided the endpoint is outside that range. Taller terrain is also passable. After crossing any of it, test once with a D6 at the end of the move. A result of 1 leaves the unit [Battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock).",
